WEBVTT

00:00:17.010 --> 00:00:20.320
Cuticle Detective Inaba

00:01:31.020 --> 00:01:33.070
Inaba
Detective
Agency

00:01:34.360 --> 00:01:36.580
Yuuta was kidnapped?!

00:01:36.940 --> 00:01:38.520
What do you think, Assistant?

00:01:38.520 --> 00:01:39.450
Something's not right...

00:01:39.470 --> 00:01:40.700
Flail Flail Flail

00:01:41.190 --> 00:01:43.630
The fact that Yuuta-kun would
be kidnapped by the goat...

00:01:43.630 --> 00:01:46.000
The fact that the evidence of that
would be sent to Ogi-san's phone...

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:48.310
The fact that he's dressed like a
princess and completely prepared,

00:01:48.310 --> 00:01:50.460
are so weird,
I can't help but think it's a trap.

00:01:50.950 --> 00:01:53.210
But of course we're going
to worry anyway, you idiot!

00:01:53.210 --> 00:01:54.170
My cell phone!

00:01:54.820 --> 00:01:55.300
Sasaki Yuuta
Kidnapping Case
Countermeasures
Headquarters

00:01:55.300 --> 00:01:59.180
Meeting Room
Sasaki Yuuta
Kidnapping Case
Countermeasures
Headquarters

00:01:59.800 --> 00:02:03.310
In the text, it says to bring the
ransom to the appointed place.

00:02:03.310 --> 00:02:05.080
It's totally a trap, then.

00:02:05.080 --> 00:02:07.510
I'm sure it is, but we can't
just ignore it, either.

00:02:07.510 --> 00:02:09.020
Well said, Ogi!

00:02:09.020 --> 00:02:10.340
<i>When you think about it,</i>

00:02:10.340 --> 00:02:10.790
<i>Ogi-san has more patience tolerating Yuuta-kun than Buddha himself.</i>

00:02:10.790 --> 00:02:14.150
They say even Buddha loses
patience after the third time...

00:02:14.360 --> 00:02:15.820
How much is the ransom?

00:02:15.820 --> 00:02:17.610
He's my assistant! I'll prepare it.

00:02:17.860 --> 00:02:19.610
yen

00:02:19.610 --> 00:02:19.630
So cheap!

00:02:19.630 --> 00:02:20.610
Cheap!

00:02:20.610 --> 00:02:21.490
I-na-ba-san...

00:02:21.490 --> 00:02:23.210
I         na       ba        san

00:02:23.210 --> 00:02:25.490
Yuuta-kun is totally taking charge here...

00:02:26.090 --> 00:02:27.440
How is this?!

00:02:27.440 --> 00:02:28.780
It is indeed a fortress, it is!

00:02:29.520 --> 00:02:31.710
So, so, what kind of trap are
you going to get them with?

00:02:32.240 --> 00:02:33.220
Is this a trap?

00:02:33.590 --> 00:02:35.170
Don't ask after pushing the button!

00:02:35.420 --> 00:02:36.050
What's this?

00:02:44.240 --> 00:02:45.180
Squish

00:02:47.120 --> 00:02:50.320
Could you... stay still for a moment?

00:02:51.390 --> 00:02:52.400
Hey, Goat...

00:02:53.320 --> 00:02:55.400
Are you taking this seriously?

00:02:55.640 --> 00:02:58.170
You said you were ready
to take Ogi-san down,

00:02:58.170 --> 00:02:59.400
so I even let you kidnap me!

00:02:59.680 --> 00:03:01.800
You'll never be able to
fatally wound him at this rate!

00:03:01.800 --> 00:03:02.930
So disappointed!

00:03:02.930 --> 00:03:04.660
What's Noah doing?

00:03:04.660 --> 00:03:07.460
N-Noah is busy with her research...

00:03:07.460 --> 00:03:10.090
So this plan just involves the stupid trio
of the goat, the bag, and the queen?!

00:03:10.090 --> 00:03:11.830
Th-Three heads are better tha—

00:03:11.830 --> 00:03:14.540
What was that, you batter-brained idiot?!

00:03:14.910 --> 00:03:17.720
Bring the mastermind here this instant!

00:03:17.720 --> 00:03:19.470
U-Understood!

00:03:20.680 --> 00:03:22.230
What?

00:03:22.230 --> 00:03:25.970
Why didn't you tell me about
something that sounds so fun?!

00:03:26.180 --> 00:03:28.390
The kidnapped princess!
The western-style palace!

00:03:28.390 --> 00:03:29.410
Fantasy!

00:03:29.780 --> 00:03:31.760
I totally have to bring
out a dragon now!

00:03:31.760 --> 00:03:34.070
We should make the inside of the
castle look like a dungeon, too!

00:03:34.070 --> 00:03:35.110
That's awesome!

00:03:35.110 --> 00:03:36.550
I'll have to deploy some monsters!

00:03:36.550 --> 00:03:37.470
Could you prepare everything?

00:03:37.470 --> 00:03:39.570
Poison works and needles
will pierce through...

00:03:39.570 --> 00:03:42.210
So his skin is sort of like steel,
but maybe closer to aluminum.

00:03:42.210 --> 00:03:44.260
But we can't cut through
muscle and bone.

00:03:44.260 --> 00:03:46.490
Guess we should give up
on cutting through him.

00:03:46.490 --> 00:03:49.700
The organ that controls
his stamina is superhuman,

00:03:49.700 --> 00:03:52.080
but maybe his immune
system is rather normal?

00:03:52.080 --> 00:03:53.580
Then, maybe acid will work.

00:03:54.320 --> 00:03:56.010
This is like a dream...

00:03:56.400 --> 00:04:00.020
To be able to plot the cop's
murder with Yuuta like this.

00:04:00.690 --> 00:04:02.840
I'm having a lot of fun right now, too.

00:04:02.840 --> 00:04:05.550
Let's do our best to make
Ogi-san cease to exist.

00:04:06.720 --> 00:04:09.710
Yuuta-kun!
Somehow I keep hearing
that one guy's voice...

00:04:09.710 --> 00:04:12.760
<i>Yuuta-kun! Yuuta-kun! Yuuta-kun!
Yuuta-kun! Yuuta-kun!</i>

00:04:13.270 --> 00:04:14.960
You're late!

00:04:14.960 --> 00:04:17.210
What the hell were you
doing, you slowpoke?!

00:04:17.210 --> 00:04:17.650
Ransom
What the hell were you
doing, you slowpoke?!

00:04:17.650 --> 00:04:19.440
I'm here at precisely the appointed time.
Ransom

00:04:19.440 --> 00:04:20.950
Oh, who cares about the ransom?!
Ransom

00:04:20.950 --> 00:04:22.690
Hurry up and go save Yuuta!
Ransom

00:04:22.690 --> 00:04:23.530
And you, Wolf, come out already!
Ransom

00:04:23.530 --> 00:04:24.400
And you, Wolf, come out already!

00:04:24.400 --> 00:04:25.070
What? She knew?

00:04:25.070 --> 00:04:29.450
I heard you were coming,
so I made a whole bunch of traps!

00:04:29.690 --> 00:04:31.080
Before I knew it...

00:04:31.470 --> 00:04:33.990
It's so full of traps
that no one can get out!

00:04:33.990 --> 00:04:35.860
Clearly, there's a fine line
between genius and idiot!

00:04:35.860 --> 00:04:37.110
What do you mean no one can
get out? Who else is there?

00:04:37.110 --> 00:04:37.980
Civilians

00:04:37.980 --> 00:04:39.090
The Don and the weakling.

00:04:39.370 --> 00:04:40.080
Haruka?!

00:04:40.470 --> 00:04:42.660
I guess there's no choice.
I'll call in reinforcements.

00:04:42.660 --> 00:04:46.250
I've also set up a time bomb
rigged to go off in an hour.

00:04:46.250 --> 00:04:48.100
What the hell are you doing, you idiot?!

00:04:48.530 --> 00:04:50.090
I guess there's no time to lose.

00:04:50.460 --> 00:04:52.070
Do you know where the three are?

00:04:52.400 --> 00:04:54.390
Yuuta's on the top floor and...

00:04:54.390 --> 00:04:57.770
I think the Don and the weakling are
together somewhere in between.

00:04:58.070 --> 00:04:59.420
Let's split up into two groups.

00:04:59.420 --> 00:05:01.730
I'll look for Haruka.
I couldn't care less about the goat.

00:05:01.730 --> 00:05:02.690
Hey!

00:05:03.140 --> 00:05:04.050
I'm counting on you.

00:05:04.740 --> 00:05:08.410
You'll be able to save Yuuta
no matter what, right?

00:05:13.120 --> 00:05:14.070
Wha— You two?

00:05:14.070 --> 00:05:15.980
Why'd you follow me?

00:05:15.980 --> 00:05:17.920
I was too worried to let you go by yourself.

00:05:17.920 --> 00:05:18.670
Yeah.

00:05:19.000 --> 00:05:21.150
There's nothing to worry about.

00:05:21.150 --> 00:05:23.090
I may look like a normal werewolf,

00:05:23.380 --> 00:05:25.170
but actually, I'm a hair fetishist!

00:05:25.170 --> 00:05:27.610
Your fetish is just
making me more nervous!

00:05:27.610 --> 00:05:30.740
Where did the cop go?
There's only one entrance.

00:05:30.740 --> 00:05:31.680
He's probably

00:05:31.700 --> 00:05:32.130
Climb
Climb

00:05:32.130 --> 00:05:33.490
climbing the outer wall.

00:05:33.490 --> 00:05:35.290
But there are tons of
traps outside, too!

00:05:35.290 --> 00:05:38.130
Eh, Ogi can handle that much.

00:05:38.130 --> 00:05:39.060
Seriously?!

00:05:39.060 --> 00:05:39.340
Climb
Climb

00:05:41.760 --> 00:05:42.920
Damn. I missed.

00:05:42.920 --> 00:05:44.530
What are you doing, Assistant?

00:05:44.890 --> 00:05:46.700
You don't have to come, Ogi-san.

00:05:47.120 --> 00:05:49.280
I want Sensei to save me.

00:05:49.880 --> 00:05:52.250
And it was Hiroshi who
asked me to save you.

00:05:52.560 --> 00:05:54.040
Stop being difficult
and let me rescue you.

00:05:58.930 --> 00:06:00.450
So he did...

00:06:01.280 --> 00:06:02.760
go save his younger brother after all...

00:06:03.760 --> 00:06:04.480
Assistant...

00:06:05.930 --> 00:06:07.080
Ow! Hot!

00:06:07.080 --> 00:06:08.050
Assistant! You ass!

00:06:09.110 --> 00:06:09.580
Acid

00:06:09.580 --> 00:06:10.540
I don't care anymore!
Acid

00:06:10.540 --> 00:06:11.830
I'll escape on my own!

00:06:11.830 --> 00:06:14.860
You idiot! I'm here because
you can't get out...

00:06:16.960 --> 00:06:19.190
The kidnapped princess and the dragon!

00:06:19.870 --> 00:06:22.820
The eternal guarantee
in the fantasy world!

00:06:23.380 --> 00:06:25.500
At least give it somewhere
bigger to live.

00:06:25.500 --> 00:06:26.490
It's squished!

00:06:26.650 --> 00:06:28.410
Go, Donragon!

00:06:29.750 --> 00:06:31.260
Is that its name?

00:06:31.260 --> 00:06:32.750
You actually named it.

00:06:33.500 --> 00:06:34.240
Take this!

00:06:37.040 --> 00:06:37.750
What?!

00:06:38.030 --> 00:06:39.510
It's poison breath.

00:06:39.510 --> 00:06:42.100
With a room this small,
it'll fill up the room in no ti—

00:06:44.590 --> 00:06:46.950
This is why I said to use a bigger room!

00:06:47.550 --> 00:06:48.880
Anyway, we're getting out of here.

00:06:49.270 --> 00:06:52.010
It's okay. You don't have to save me.

00:06:54.820 --> 00:06:56.870
He doesn't want to save me anyway.

00:06:57.480 --> 00:06:59.770
He cares more about his
brother than his assistant.

00:07:00.320 --> 00:07:02.490
He cares more about his
partner than his assistant.

00:07:03.080 --> 00:07:05.690
And he cares more about
the black-haired assistant

00:07:05.690 --> 00:07:07.400
than the blonde assistant.

00:07:07.900 --> 00:07:08.970
