the only one who could save you.

00:07:15.750 --> 00:07:18.530
He knew I'd have a better
chance than even he would.

00:07:18.530 --> 00:07:21.670
He picked you as the one
he wanted to save the most!

00:07:22.110 --> 00:07:23.960
Stop being a baby about it!

00:07:34.620 --> 00:07:36.850
What the hell is that?! We can't get out!

00:07:37.170 --> 00:07:38.900
Well, that's because
it's guarding the gate!

00:07:38.900 --> 00:07:40.520
You need to put the gate
guard outside the gate!

00:07:40.520 --> 00:07:41.540
From the left, it's Cer Ber Os!

00:07:41.540 --> 00:07:42.040
Cer

00:07:42.040 --> 00:07:42.540
Ber

00:07:42.540 --> 00:07:42.870
Os

00:07:42.870 --> 00:07:44.770
At least tweak the name a little!

00:07:45.070 --> 00:07:45.520
Especially for Os!

00:07:45.520 --> 00:07:46.190
Os

00:07:46.190 --> 00:07:46.840
It should be Cer Be Ros!

00:07:46.840 --> 00:07:47.400
Cer

00:07:47.400 --> 00:07:48.190
Be

00:07:48.190 --> 00:07:48.950
Ros

00:07:48.950 --> 00:07:49.320
It should be Cer Be Ros!

00:07:49.320 --> 00:07:52.030
You know, I honestly don't give a
crap about your logic right now!

00:07:58.550 --> 00:07:59.190
Ogi!

00:07:59.540 --> 00:08:01.210
There you are, Hiroshi. Perfect timing.

00:08:01.820 --> 00:08:03.080
Do you know where the antidote is?

00:08:03.080 --> 00:08:04.120
Your assistant is in danger.

00:08:04.460 --> 00:08:05.580
Yuuta is?

00:08:05.980 --> 00:08:07.460
What happened, Yuuta?

00:08:07.760 --> 00:08:09.730
He inhaled Donragon's poison breath.

00:08:09.730 --> 00:08:10.800
Hurry and heal him.

00:08:12.700 --> 00:08:13.460
This isn't good.

00:08:13.460 --> 00:08:14.710
They're all cracked from the chaos.

00:08:14.710 --> 00:08:16.720
Hiroshi. Get a white hair and heal him.

00:08:16.980 --> 00:08:18.050
I can't.

00:08:18.050 --> 00:08:19.880
I need Yuuta to push
the pressure points,

00:08:19.880 --> 00:08:20.930
or I can't transform.

00:08:23.030 --> 00:08:23.940
Damn it!

00:08:23.940 --> 00:08:25.900
Curse you, Valentino!

00:08:26.300 --> 00:08:26.380
Me?!

00:08:26.380 --> 00:08:27.110
M
E
!?
Me?!

00:08:27.110 --> 00:08:27.360
M
E
!?

00:08:28.450 --> 00:08:31.280
Ogi, you inhaled some
poison, too, didn't you?

00:08:31.280 --> 00:08:32.610
Assistant! Wake up!

00:08:33.130 --> 00:08:35.070
Don't give up!
You're a man, aren't you?!

00:08:35.510 --> 00:08:37.950
I'm somehow getting blamed for this?!

00:08:37.950 --> 00:08:38.990
Beats me.

00:08:38.990 --> 00:08:40.940
More importantly, you're a mafia boss.

00:08:40.940 --> 00:08:42.540
Why are you freaking out?

00:08:42.880 --> 00:08:44.000
Wake up!

00:08:44.500 --> 00:08:45.710
It's your job!

00:08:46.070 --> 00:08:48.170
You're Hiroshi's assistant!
Show some resolve!

00:08:49.230 --> 00:08:49.920
Yuuta!

00:08:51.760 --> 00:08:52.840
Ow.

00:08:53.210 --> 00:08:55.800
What is this? Sexual harrassment?

00:08:55.800 --> 00:08:56.410
Yuuta!

00:08:56.410 --> 00:08:57.380
Gush
Yuuta!

00:08:57.380 --> 00:08:57.710
Gush

00:08:57.940 --> 00:09:00.310
Don't worry, Yuuta. I'll heal you.

00:09:00.310 --> 00:09:01.890
I'm counting on you, Assistant!

00:09:03.230 --> 00:09:05.390
I'm pushing a few more than usual.

00:09:05.850 --> 00:09:08.470
Whoa, what's this extra service?
I'm overflowing!

00:09:08.470 --> 00:09:11.360
I'm super overflowing!

00:09:14.290 --> 00:09:16.410
It really did explode.

00:09:16.410 --> 00:09:18.020
I'm glad everyone is okay.

00:09:18.020 --> 00:09:21.370
No kidding. It looks like Noah
and the others got away, too.

00:09:21.760 --> 00:09:24.730
Yuuta-kun, make sure you
apologize to Ogi-san.

00:09:24.730 --> 00:09:26.290
Either that or thank him.

00:09:26.290 --> 00:09:29.060
Huh? Why are my two
choices both so extreme?

00:09:29.060 --> 00:09:31.590
It's like you're asking me if I
want to drown or burn to death.

00:09:32.520 --> 00:09:34.470
It's fine. I wasn't expecting anything.

00:09:35.230 --> 00:09:37.930
Come on, now, Yuuta-kun.
Listen to him.

00:09:41.480 --> 00:09:44.020
I heart you, Ogi-san!

00:09:47.090 --> 00:09:48.530
O-Ogi-san!

00:09:48.860 --> 00:09:49.590
Ogi-san!

00:09:49.590 --> 00:09:50.900
Ogi!
Ogi-san!

00:09:53.410 --> 00:09:56.150
Apparently, he was petrified
for an entire day.

00:09:58.880 --> 00:10:00.590
With you guys here,
it's bound to happen.

00:10:00.590 --> 00:10:02.770
A country without false
charges or suspicions.

00:10:09.710 --> 00:10:11.310
The passionate police officer Joji

00:10:11.310 --> 00:10:12.890
proclaims his ideals with a serious face.

00:10:13.510 --> 00:10:16.430
I absolutely despised that about you.

00:10:18.110 --> 00:10:18.590
Inaba Family
Breakdown Case
