You fool!

00:10:44.620 --> 00:10:45.480
I'm sorry!
You fool!

00:10:45.480 --> 00:10:46.370
I'm sorry!

00:10:46.370 --> 00:10:50.120
So the two of you haven't
fought Ogi-san head-on yet.

00:10:50.290 --> 00:10:52.490
You've known him for a while,
haven't you, Weakling?

00:10:52.490 --> 00:10:54.190
Don't you have any useful information?

00:10:54.190 --> 00:10:58.260
A younger brother usually only has
interest in his older brother.

00:10:58.260 --> 00:10:59.840
In what world is that usual?

00:11:02.250 --> 00:11:04.710
Speak of the devil.
Apparently, Ogi-san is here.

00:11:04.710 --> 00:11:05.410
What?!

00:11:05.410 --> 00:11:06.710
We must retreat!

00:11:06.710 --> 00:11:09.050
It's a police raid, it is!

00:11:10.950 --> 00:11:11.680
Yes?

00:11:13.830 --> 00:11:15.790
What are you doing, Soumei-san?!

00:11:15.790 --> 00:11:17.440
This is no time to mess around!

00:11:17.440 --> 00:11:18.790
Let's go already.

00:11:18.790 --> 00:11:20.030
You guys go on ahead.

00:11:20.030 --> 00:11:21.660
I'll take care of the cop.

00:11:21.660 --> 00:11:22.950
Do you plan on killing Yataro?!

00:11:23.850 --> 00:11:24.770
Can you do it?

00:11:25.180 --> 00:11:26.580
Well, whatever.

00:11:27.310 --> 00:11:29.580
Do your best. I'll pray for your safety.

00:11:30.660 --> 00:11:31.520
Liar.

00:11:33.090 --> 00:11:34.460
It's like an empty shell.

00:11:35.040 --> 00:11:36.420
Looks like they ran off.

00:11:37.040 --> 00:11:39.430
They could be hiding somewhere.

00:11:39.430 --> 00:11:41.570
Mmwah!

00:11:42.780 --> 00:11:44.400
There's one! Come on, Kenmochi!

00:11:44.400 --> 00:11:45.050
Inspector!

00:11:45.580 --> 00:11:47.280
Damn! He's super fast!

00:11:47.280 --> 00:11:47.830
Hold it!

00:11:48.970 --> 00:11:50.720
Be mindful of how you handle this.

00:11:50.720 --> 00:11:51.770
This is my vessel.

00:11:52.380 --> 00:11:54.230
Ow...

00:11:54.230 --> 00:11:56.540
No fair! You're totally cheating
with that body of yours!

00:11:56.540 --> 00:11:58.650
I'm going to handcuff
you now, so hold still.

00:12:00.650 --> 00:12:02.050
Maybe I'm imagining it,

00:12:02.630 --> 00:12:04.870
