You're late, Kenmochi.

00:12:14.400 --> 00:12:16.340
I came as fast as I could, but
I have no idea what's going on.

00:12:17.420 --> 00:12:19.800
What's the meaning of
this, Inspector Ogino?

00:12:20.670 --> 00:12:23.780
Why do I smell the scent of Joji on you?

00:12:25.220 --> 00:12:26.290
What are you talking about?

00:12:26.290 --> 00:12:27.520
Don't play dumb!

00:12:27.520 --> 00:12:28.770
I'm talking about the stupid policeman

00:12:28.770 --> 00:12:30.720
who blew a hole in his
own head thirty years ago,

00:12:30.720 --> 00:12:32.170
Jojima Kaoru.

00:12:32.170 --> 00:12:33.080
You know him, don't you?

00:12:33.660 --> 00:12:34.730
That's the name of my grandfather.

00:12:36.760 --> 00:12:37.540
What?

00:12:40.270 --> 00:12:41.400
What the hell?

00:12:41.800 --> 00:12:43.070
What the hell is wrong with you?

00:12:43.520 --> 00:12:45.880
Why are you a cop?!

00:12:45.880 --> 00:12:47.620
I'll hear what you have
to say at the station.

00:12:48.190 --> 00:12:49.120
Can you walk?

00:12:49.370 --> 00:12:53.080
I guess stupidity runs in the family.

00:13:00.390 --> 00:13:02.040
Totally scored the ultimate body!

00:13:02.040 --> 00:13:04.240
It sure feels different seeing you small, Yata.

00:13:04.770 --> 00:13:05.680
Inspector?

00:13:08.880 --> 00:13:10.390
Give my regards to Hiroshi.

00:13:13.230 --> 00:13:15.380
Man, that was scary.

00:13:15.380 --> 00:13:16.850
The gun had no effect at all.

00:13:17.130 --> 00:13:19.270
Apparently, poisoning him is
the only way to kill him.

00:13:19.940 --> 00:13:22.030
Poison, huh? Lend me your phone.

00:13:24.240 --> 00:13:26.730
What in the world are you doing?!
Hurry up and get home!

00:13:26.730 --> 00:13:28.570
Do you know how worried I was?!

00:13:28.570 --> 00:13:29.950
Take better care of Yata!

00:13:29.950 --> 00:13:30.440
Glue Stick
Craft          Scissors

00:13:30.440 --> 00:13:33.410
We're gonna kill the cop,
so get the poison ready.
Craft          Scissors
Glue Stick

00:13:33.830 --> 00:13:35.840
I'll figure out someplace
to dispose of the body.

00:13:35.840 --> 00:13:38.380
I'll call you when I decide
on one, so bring it there.

00:13:38.750 --> 00:13:41.590
I have to drink it,
so make it a painless one.

00:13:41.590 --> 00:13:42.620
So he says.

00:13:42.620 --> 00:13:43.550
Got it!

00:13:44.110 --> 00:13:46.460
Then, we'll head over
to Noah-san's place.

00:13:46.460 --> 00:13:48.580
If you make Yata cry,
I'm going to headbutt you.

00:13:48.580 --> 00:13:49.260
Sure thing.

00:13:49.790 --> 00:13:51.220
I'm terribly sorry.

00:13:51.220 --> 00:13:54.220
Don't sweat it.
That's what makes Nacchan cute.

00:13:54.540 --> 00:13:57.660
If Nacchan ended up like the rest
of you as well, it'd be lonely.

00:13:57.660 --> 00:13:58.930
Relax, relax.

00:14:00.290 --> 00:14:02.230
What do you mean, Ogi's disappeared?

00:14:02.410 --> 00:14:03.160
We'd like to get to the bottom of it, as well.
That's why we're here.

00:14:03.160 --> 00:14:04.940
Why are you looking at me?
We'd like to get to the bottom of it, as well.
That's why we're here.

00:14:05.270 --> 00:14:08.410
Officer Kenmochi, who was with him,
is unconscious and in critical condition.

00:14:09.400 --> 00:14:11.010
Here is Officer Kenmochi's hair.

00:14:11.770 --> 00:14:13.950
Please find out what happened to them.

00:14:19.120 --> 00:14:21.990
You don't have to be so serious.

00:14:21.990 --> 00:14:25.550
Just cut his bangs already.
It's not like he's going to live long.

00:14:26.010 --> 00:14:28.860
I can't do anything half-heartedly
if it involves you.

00:14:29.380 --> 00:14:31.170
You're too close.

00:14:31.170 --> 00:14:33.310
You're supposed to look at
the whole head as you cut.

00:14:40.140 --> 00:14:41.270
Soumei-san?

00:14:41.270 --> 00:14:43.480
Pet me. I'm feeling a little blue.

00:14:46.280 --> 00:14:49.030
This guy says he's Joji's grandson.

00:14:49.690 --> 00:14:51.800
Really made me realize it's been thirty years.

00:14:52.580 --> 00:14:53.990
Is Joji-san is the police inspector

00:14:54.500 --> 00:14:57.960
who killed himself on the night
of the full moon thirty years ago?

00:14:58.370 --> 00:15:00.670
I heard that you two didn't get along.

00:15:01.560 --> 00:15:04.090
The heart of the police
force was corrupt,

00:15:04.090 --> 00:15:06.170
so the wolves' opposition was strong.

00:15:06.190 --> 00:15:06.430
Purr Purr

00:15:06.430 --> 00:15:10.130
We would act out the
person-versus-wolf fight quite often.
Purr Purr

00:15:10.160 --> 00:15:10.790
Metropolitan Police Department

00:15:10.790 --> 00:15:12.700
At the time, even if someone
was faced with false charges,

00:15:12.700 --> 00:15:15.100
they would win if they could
just get them to confess.

00:15:15.100 --> 00:15:17.150
Out of all of the corrupt
cops who believed that

00:15:17.150 --> 00:15:18.890
all you needed to do
to get a confession

00:15:18.890 --> 00:15:21.660
was rough them up a little
and guide them along,

00:15:21.660 --> 00:15:24.310
was one inexperienced guy
who didn't subscribe to that.

00:15:24.310 --> 00:15:25.690
That was Joji.

00:15:27.420 --> 00:15:29.240
Don't worry, they'll never find out.

00:15:29.730 --> 00:15:31.350
I got rid of all of the evidence.

00:15:31.350 --> 00:15:32.920
All I have to do is keep crying.

00:15:35.620 --> 00:15:37.210
Hey, I'm gonna butt in.

00:15:37.210 --> 00:15:38.990
What are you doing here, Soumei?

00:15:38.990 --> 00:15:41.170
What do you mean? I'm here to help.

00:15:41.670 --> 00:15:42.540
Pardon me.

00:15:43.290 --> 00:15:44.000
Hey, you!

00:15:44.000 --> 00:15:44.750
What are you—

00:15:44.750 --> 00:15:45.340
Here you go.

00:15:46.680 --> 00:15:48.510
The victim's blood is on
the bottom of her shoe.

00:15:48.810 --> 00:15:49.660
Sorry that I butted in.

00:15:52.210 --> 00:15:54.300
Wait! How'd you know that?

00:15:54.680 --> 00:15:56.780
Smell. I have a good nose.

00:15:57.430 --> 00:15:58.880
Welcome to being a detective,

00:15:58.880 --> 00:16:00.350
Assistant Inspector Jojima.

00:16:01.840 --> 00:16:03.650
To welcome you,
I'll let you in on a little secret.

00:16:04.240 --> 00:16:06.110
The suspect's panties were black.

00:16:07.310 --> 00:16:08.570
Who are you?!

00:16:08.570 --> 00:16:10.150
During the eighteen years he was with me,

00:16:10.620 --> 00:16:12.840
Joji was yelling a lot.

00:16:14.550 --> 00:16:16.290
A rock as the murder
weapon should be fine.

00:16:17.340 --> 00:16:19.620
Place something that matches
the wound at the scene.

00:16:20.130 --> 00:16:22.460
The plan is to find it after
the suspect's confession.

00:16:22.950 --> 00:16:24.710
What did you use as your murder weapon?

00:16:24.710 --> 00:16:25.640
Was it a rock?

00:16:26.070 --> 00:16:28.540
A rock? It might have been.

00:16:31.970 --> 00:16:33.680
Whoa, you okay there?

00:16:34.090 --> 00:16:35.350
Soumei-san.

00:16:35.350 --> 00:16:37.140
You two, clean that up for her.

00:16:37.320 --> 00:16:39.580
I'm sorry, Soumei-san.

00:16:39.580 --> 00:16:42.710
I guess I fail at being
a Secret Doberman.

00:16:42.710 --> 00:16:45.170
Don't worry about it.
Everyone's like that at first.

00:16:45.530 --> 00:16:46.830
Throwing up from the stench of lies

00:16:46.830 --> 00:16:48.110
only proves your brilliance.

00:16:48.510 --> 00:16:50.150
It's worse than usual today.

00:16:50.530 --> 00:16:53.260
Have the ones with heightened senses
of smell and hearing wait outside.

00:16:53.260 --> 00:16:53.820
Right.

00:16:54.240 --> 00:16:56.910
But I wanna stay with you, Soumei-san.

00:16:56.910 --> 00:16:58.850
Don't get in the way, kid.
It's getting good.

00:17:00.160 --> 00:17:02.790
You have the best nose,
don't you, Soumei-san?

00:17:02.790 --> 00:17:04.190
How are you okay?

00:17:04.190 --> 00:17:05.580
That's because I'm special.

00:17:05.580 --> 00:17:06.300
Soumei!

00:17:06.300 --> 00:17:07.920
And here comes the loud one.

00:17:08.250 --> 00:17:10.160
You're full of energy as usual, Joji.

00:17:10.160 --> 00:17:12.380
Is it true that you sent
my daughter high heels?!

00:17:12.600 --> 00:17:15.170
I thought I'd help her out since she
was turning into a fine young woman.

00:17:15.170 --> 00:17:16.710
Don't you dare lay a
hand on my daughter!

00:17:18.220 --> 00:17:18.850
What's going on?

00:17:19.930 --> 00:17:21.630
You wouldn't understand.

00:17:22.890 --> 00:17:26.850
My comrades were starting to
break under the storm of lies.

00:17:27.480 --> 00:17:29.300
I had planned to tough it out.

00:17:30.020 --> 00:17:31.820
Soumei-san! Please come quickly!

00:17:35.240 --> 00:17:36.700
Soumei-san.

00:17:37.900 --> 00:17:40.200
I told you not to take
information from blood...

00:17:41.170 --> 00:17:42.890
Your mouth is all sticky.

00:17:42.890 --> 00:17:45.140
Am I going to be disposed of?

00:17:46.020 --> 00:17:48.400
No! Save me, Soumei-san!

00:17:49.630 --> 00:17:50.740
I'm sorry.

00:17:53.800 --> 00:17:54.760
Send me, then.

00:17:55.570 --> 00:17:57.670
You be the one to dispose
of me, Soumei-san!

00:17:58.710 --> 00:17:59.720
Sounds good.

00:17:59.720 --> 00:18:01.410
I'd like to request that, as well.

00:18:01.410 --> 00:18:02.720
Thank goodness!

00:18:02.720 --> 00:18:05.180
You can go in peace if it's Soumei-san.

00:18:05.180 --> 00:18:07.110
Please, Soumei-san.

00:18:09.060 --> 00:18:11.070
I toughed it out again, and again...

00:18:12.560 --> 00:18:16.080
and before I knew it,
I was only holding myself up.

00:18:20.740 --> 00:18:21.280
Wha—

00:18:21.620 --> 00:18:23.490
Why are you dressed like that?

00:18:23.490 --> 00:18:26.070
They're burial clothes for Soumei-san.

00:18:26.690 --> 00:18:30.750
The lives of us Secret Dobermans
belong to Soumei-san.

00:18:30.750 --> 00:18:34.460
Humans only understand
things that they can see.

00:18:34.890 --> 00:18:38.140
Do you understand who's the only
one who can order us around now?

00:18:39.690 --> 00:18:41.640
Soumei, did you order this?

00:18:41.920 --> 00:18:43.370
Have them stop this right now!

00:18:44.240 --> 00:18:47.180
Hey, Joji.
You're as energetic as ever.

00:18:47.490 --> 00:18:49.220
Did you decide on your grandson's name?

00:18:49.220 --> 00:18:50.000
Stop fooling around!

00:18:50.600 --> 00:18:54.150
The wolves, lately, only listen to you
and refuse to comply with humans.

00:18:54.750 --> 00:18:57.380
We should be working together
as forces who uphold justice.

00:18:59.490 --> 00:19:00.610
Joji.

00:19:01.630 --> 00:19:03.890
Do you still not understand
that the police department

00:19:03.890 --> 00:19:05.080
is the criminal organization?

00:19:07.230 --> 00:19:11.480
Seriously, I guess your
stupidity never changes.

00:19:13.820 --> 00:19:16.050
So the reason is the
police force itself?

00:19:18.140 --> 00:19:20.000
Because I had believed in your nose,

00:19:20.000 --> 00:19:21.590
I was able to go up in the ranks myself.

00:19:21.950 --> 00:19:25.070
And that's exactly why, if there's
any corruption among the police,

00:19:25.070 --> 00:19:26.220
I should be the one
who takes care of it.

00:19:28.120 --> 00:19:31.020
Joji had believed in both the
wolves and the police force.

00:19:31.500 --> 00:19:34.010
And that's why they levied
false charges against him,

00:19:34.010 --> 00:19:37.480
saying that he was an old
man who had gone mad.

00:19:39.270 --> 00:19:42.460
He had believed in them so much
that the shock was unbearable.

00:19:42.460 --> 00:19:44.540
He wrote his suicide note,
and that was the end.

00:19:45.010 --> 00:19:46.450
There was a suicide note?

00:19:46.450 --> 00:19:49.910
I didn't read it that well,
so I don't really remember.

00:19:50.980 --> 00:19:52.500
Please forgive me, Soumei.

00:19:53.400 --> 00:19:55.730
I didn't realize how sad it must have been

00:19:55.730 --> 00:19:57.830
to not be able to gain anyone's trust.

00:19:58.680 --> 00:19:58.910
<i>His testimony lacks credibility.</i>

00:19:58.910 --> 00:20:01.080
I didn't know how difficult it was to hold
on to the truth while living among lies.

00:20:01.080 --> 00:20:03.820
The witness actually believes
that werewolves exist.

00:20:03.820 --> 00:20:05.590
Up until then, I had thought
that we were equals.

00:20:05.590 --> 00:20:07.810
It is hard to believe that he
is in the right state of mind.

00:20:07.810 --> 00:20:08.360
I had no idea you were
holding all of that in

00:20:08.360 --> 00:20:11.350
You all feared their abilities
and never trusted them,

00:20:11.350 --> 00:20:11.660
<i>yet you're going to use them here?
I had no idea you were
holding all of that in</i>

00:20:11.660 --> 00:20:12.980
and dealing with it on your own.
<i>yet you're going to use them here?</i>

00:20:12.980 --> 00:20:14.980
<i>The court finds the defendant guilty.</i>

00:20:16.000 --> 00:20:17.980
Ignorance worthy of death.

00:20:22.360 --> 00:20:22.430
I can't imagine the world
through your eyes, but...

00:20:22.430 --> 00:20:24.040
<i>You did it, didn't you?!
I can't imagine the world
through your eyes, but...</i>

00:20:24.040 --> 00:20:25.330
<i>Hurry up and confess!
I can't imagine the world
through your eyes, but...</i>

00:20:25.330 --> 00:20:25.770
I can't imagine the world
through your eyes, but...

00:20:25.770 --> 00:20:27.900
<i>How did you come to that conclusion?</i>

00:20:28.430 --> 00:20:29.580
<i>There was a suicide note!</i>

00:20:30.560 --> 00:20:32.290
Next time, I'd like to see
things the way you do.

00:20:33.100 --> 00:20:34.040
Next time...

00:20:34.040 --> 00:20:35.030
Let's be partners.

00:20:35.030 --> 00:20:36.230
Let's be partners...
Let's be partners.

00:20:36.230 --> 00:20:37.460
Let's be partners.

00:20:37.690 --> 00:20:39.420
Such a thing doesn't exist.

00:20:42.150 --> 00:20:44.430
No matter how much I may be in the way,

00:20:44.900 --> 00:20:46.750
there is no justification in throwing that away.

00:20:47.080 --> 00:20:48.760
I'm telling you there's no suicide note.

00:20:48.760 --> 00:20:49.870
Don't lie!

00:20:52.010 --> 00:20:53.940
Do you know how wolves hunt?

00:20:55.860 --> 00:20:57.210
It doesn't matter how big the prey is,

00:20:57.210 --> 00:20:58.380
the pack will chase it.

00:20:58.380 --> 00:21:00.370
They'll chase it all night if they must.

00:21:00.370 --> 00:21:03.680
If the first pack tires out,
the next pack takes over.

00:21:04.360 --> 00:21:07.220
What are you talking about?!
Stop talking nonsense!

00:21:07.220 --> 00:21:09.620
They wear out the prey and
then go in for the kill.

00:21:12.170 --> 00:21:14.480
You are now

00:21:14.480 --> 00:21:15.890
my prey.

00:21:18.190 --> 00:21:20.960
It's a bit small, but it should fit.

00:21:21.380 --> 00:21:22.240
How's the cement coming?

00:21:24.490 --> 00:21:26.540
Are you sure you're okay with this?

00:21:27.320 --> 00:21:30.210
You're so nice, it's tiring.

00:21:30.210 --> 00:21:33.050
I'd even kill Joji at this
point if he got in the way.

00:21:33.050 --> 00:21:34.230
I have no hesitations.

00:21:34.540 --> 00:21:36.190
I will kill Ogino here.

00:21:46.220 --> 00:21:48.230
So, you followed the scent here.

00:21:48.230 --> 00:21:50.010
You may be rotten,
but you're definitely my kid.

00:21:50.720 --> 00:21:52.770
I'm not going to forgive you for this,

00:21:54.090 --> 00:21:55.130
Soumei!

00:23:26.360 --> 00:23:28.890
All right, I'll begin
the healing process.

00:23:28.890 --> 00:23:30.550
Wait! I'm first!

00:23:30.550 --> 00:23:32.250
Hey, now. Wait your turn!

00:23:32.730 --> 00:23:36.570
You were watching the
Inaba anime on your phone?

00:23:36.570 --> 00:23:38.510
You shouldn't be watching that.

00:23:38.510 --> 00:23:40.560
I'm sorry. I won't do it again.
